        {"zh": "蹒跚着接近猎物", "en": "Stagger towards prey"},
        {"zh": "发出呻吟声”，继续行走", "en": "Groan, continue walking"},
        {"zh": "痛苦地爬行向前", "en": "Crawl forward in pain"},
        {"zh": "蹒跚着穿过沼泽", "en": "Struggle through the swamp"},
